 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "回到开头的节点。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.112,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "它的关键，是按来源区别对待。",
   "spoken": "它的关键，是按来源区别对待。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 3.932,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 4.03,
   "speechEnd": 6.339
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "你从别的 IP 去查，它就给你真数据。",
   "spoken": "你从别的 IP 去查，它就给你真数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.392,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 7.49,
   "speechEnd": 10.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "所以防线不是多看几次同一个节点，而是比对不同运营方的数据源。",
   "spoken": "所以防线不是多看几次同一个节点，而是比对不同运营方的数据源。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 11.044,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 11.142,
   "speechEnd": 16.082
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "第一条，多源校验。",
   "spoken": "第一条，多源较验。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.144,
   "dur": 2.472,
   "speechStart": 17.242,
   "speechEnd": 18.789
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "充值扫描和跨链放行，至少用两个独立来源，比如自建节点加一家第三方 RPC。",
   "spoken": "充值扫描和跨链放行，至少用两个独立来源，比如自建节点加一家第三方 RPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 19.836,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 19.934,
   "speechEnd": 26.91
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "独立要按运营方算，同一家服务商的两个节点，只算一个。",
   "spoken": "独立要按运营方算，同一家服务商的两个节点，只算一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.976,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 28.074,
   "speechEnd": 32.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "第二条，不降级。",
   "spoken": "第二条，不降级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.236,
   "dur": 2.352,
   "speechStart": 33.334,
   "speechEnd": 34.75
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "节点超时后，法定数不自动下降。",
   "spoken": "节点超时后，法定数不自动下降。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 35.808,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 35.906,
   "speechEnd": 38.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "达不到法定数就暂停，人工确认。",
   "spoken": "达不到法定数就暂停，人工确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 39.724,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 39.822,
   "speechEnd": 42.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "开头的事件里，干净的 RPC 被打掉，系统自动切到剩下的节点，这就是降级。",
   "spoken": "开头的事件里，干净的 RPC 被打掉，系统自动切到剩下的节点，这就是降级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 43.712,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 43.81,
   "speechEnd": 50.095
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "第三条，结果冲突就暂停入账，不挑一个先用。",
   "spoken": "第三条，结果冲突就暂停入账，不挑一个先用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.156,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 51.254,
   "speechEnd": 55.075
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "第四条，节点本身也要比对。",
   "spoken": "第四条，节点本身也要比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 56.128,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 56.226,
   "speechEnd": 58.499
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "链头要和不同网络、不同运营方的来源持续比对，对等连接也要来自不同网络。",
   "spoken": "链头要和不同网络、不同运营方的来源持续比对，对等连接也要来自不同网络。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 59.564,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 59.662,
   "speechEnd": 65.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "自建节点可以选少数派客户端，或者两种客户端互相比对，硬分叉前完成升级。",
   "spoken": "自建节点可以选少数派客户端，或者两种客户端互相比对，硬分岔前完成升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 66.576,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 66.674,
   "speechEnd": 73.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "这几条，对被替换的节点、被日蚀的节点、停在错误分叉上的节点，都有效。",
   "spoken": "这几条，对被替换的节点、被日蚀的节点、停在错误分岔上的节点，都有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 74.092,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 74.19,
   "speechEnd": 80.285
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "局限是，如果所有来源都接在同一个上游，数量再多也没用。",
   "spoken": "局限是，如果所有来源都接在同一个上游，数量再多也没用。",
